# Open Decisions

Source-controlled queue for decisions that need the user's input before they become durable project behavior. Do not treat chat-only approval as durable unless it is also reflected here, in a `decisions/` record, or in an ADR.

## Status Values

| Status | Meaning |
| --- | --- |
| `needs_user` | User needs to approve, reject, or redirect. |
| `approved` | User approved; implementation may proceed. |
| `rejected` | User rejected the decision. |
| `deferred` | Not required for the current phase. |
| `implemented` | Approved decision has been implemented. |

